import orchestrate as team
team.SOURCE_DIST=team.ROOT/'.qa/release/dist'
common='''You are part of the second production wave for Little Raft, an original first-person cooperative raft game for two brothers (youngest6). Read the user references under references/ if visual work. Current source is in dist/. All workers are isolated. Only edit your assigned file(s), no game.js edits, no shell/git/deploy/network or additional agents. Coordinator integrates and tests. Keep performance good on Apple Silicon. No emojis, copyrighted game assets or new dependencies. Return concrete API, summary, unverified risks. '''
team.JOBS={
 'player-physics':common+'''Create dist/player-physics.js pure ES module export class PlayerPhysics with constructor({x=0,y=1.8,z=1.2,vx=0,vy=0,vz=0,swimming=false}={}); position is EYE position. Public fields x,y,z,vx,vy,vz,grounded,swimming,verticalSpeed; capture()->plain state. update(dt,{forward=0,strafe=0,yaw=0,jump=false,sprint=false,tiles,deckY=.2,waterY=-.24,blocked=[]}) returns {landed:boolean,splashed:boolean,leftWater:boolean}. Walk speed2.6 sprint4, jump impulse4.6 gravity12, eye offset1.6 so standing y=deckY+1.6. Allow walking completely OFF raft edges; no invisible edge barrier. Body radius.25, floor coverage tile2x2 at [tx,tz] integer. Vertical collision only when falling onto a raft tile and feet cross deckY. Jump only on rising edge of jump input when grounded; hold jump in water swims upward buoyancy. Swimming when feet below waterY+.1 without floor support, target eye height waterY+.45, buoyancy spring and drag, swim horizontal2.1. At raft edge in water, Space held near a tile edge automatically climbs to top if within .8 of supported tile: explicit friendly auto-clamber no hard respawn or teleport across ocean. Allow smooth jumping back onto deck. Blocked circular props optional circle{x,z,r} axis sliding; no clipping but allow escape if initially inside. Clamp dt<=.05; no dependencies/THREE/DOM. Bound far distance from raft50 resets to nearest tile as safety only if absurd distance; explain maybe omit. Stable finite math on invalid dt/input. No mutation of tiles or input. Tests by coordinator. Only player-physics.js.''',
 'inventory-data':common+'''Create dist/inventory-data.js pure ES module exporting STACK_SIZE=20; buildStacks(stock,fish=0,order=[]) -> array of {id,kind,count,max:20} for wood,leaf,scrap,fish, each count1..20, deterministic id kind:index, no loss/duplication, no zero slots. Stock canonical counts shared game world; inventory is real stacked view of those resources, not separate fake counts. Validate finite nonnegative ints cap1e6, stacksizealways20. Order accepts array of stable IDs to rearrange then appends unknown/new stacks by kind order. Also export describeCost(cost,stock)->{affordable,missing:[{kind,count}],text}, reorderStacks(order,sourceId,targetId,currentStacks)->new ID list no mutation; serializeInventoryOrder safe function optional. NO DOM, random, THREE. Tests cover 0,20,21,41,negative,NaN,retaining sums. Only inventory-data.js.''',
 'inventory-panel':common+'''Create dist/inventory-ui.js export createInventoryUI({getStock,getFish,onRecipe,onClose}={}) -> {open(),close(),update(),destroy(),get isOpen()}. Import {buildStacks,describeCost,reorderStacks} from ./inventory-data.js (another worker). Build a proper original Raft-inspired inventory/crafting dialog id inventory, injected CSS id raft-inventory-style; warm worn brown/tan panel and dark square slots with custom icons.svg. 6column grid scrollable, slots counts bottomright always <=20; title Inventory with STACKS OF20 small; left sidebar crafting recipes floor2wood,sail4wood3leaf,palm2wood3leaf,lantern1wood2scrap,net3wood2leaf,bench3wood,crate4wood1scrap if supported by engine (onRecipe may reject). Eachrecipe shows available/required materials and clickable craftselect. Clicking recipe calls onRecipe(type), closes, parent selects build. NO inventory resource mutation: shared stock remains canonical source. Drag stacks reorders visual slots via localStorage little-raft-slot-order using helper; quantities exact. Keyboard Tab or I when playing opens/closes, Escape nativecancel closes and onClose; parent E will also call open(). Open exits pointerlock; no auto pointer capture, onClose callback handles. DOM stable across hot swaps; destroy aborts only OWN handlers, never removes a newly adopted dialog; ownership token. update when visible only can run every200ms internally? no timer ideally parent calls frame update; use countsignature avoid repaints that break drag. Include Resume/close button. Accessible labels/readable14px material labels, no emoji/obsolete web dashboard. All icons SVG href icons.svg#icon-kind, no texticon. Only inventory-ui.js.''',
 'water-effects':common+'''Create dist/waterfx.js exporting createWaterEffects(T)->{group,splash(x,y,z,strength=1),update(dt,time),dispose()}. Original light realistic water splashes on stepping/jumping into ocean and hook impact. Use pooled max48 particles and8 ripple rings, reuse all geometry/mats and no allocation per-frame. Tiny bright drops with parabolic gravity plus translucent thin ring circles spreading/fading horizontal, muted foamcream andteal, no sprites/textures/external assets/lights. splash strong1player/ .35hook. group addscene, root originworld coords, no cameras/DOM. update dtclamp. every effect dies1.5s; initialallhidden. Each emitter owns materials/geos. No timers. Only waterfx.js.''',
 'ocean-audio':common+'''Create dist/audio.js export createOceanAudio({context=null,volume=.5}={}) -> {context,resume(),setVolume(v),play(event,strength=1),destroy()}. Original procedural browser audio, replace generic sine beeps with tactile muted wood knock/build, rope swish/throw, small splash, light click/collect, repair scrape, swimming splash, and very quiet filtered surf ambience. AudioContext only created/resumed inside resume() called usergesture; if provided preserve it. Use short generated noise buffers+filters+few oscillators. No audio files/dependencies/permissions/mic. All gain flows one master clamp0..1 low comfortable output; ambience .025 max. destroy stops/disconnects OWN sources/nodes but NEVER closes supplied context (hot update preserve). Context getter must return latest context if lazycreated; play fails silently if unsupported. Events enum throw,splash,collect,build,repair,jump,swim,ui. No DOM timers (AudioScheduledSource stoptimes okay), no onload autoplay. Only audio.js.''',
 'sky-model':common+'''Create dist/sky.js export createSky(T)->{group,update(time,camera),dispose()}. Original realistic calm ocean sky as in reference warm hazy cream horizon, desaturated pale blue upper sky, softsun disk broad halo. Use insideout SphereGeometry radius150 (camera far200), ShaderMaterial gradient horizon #cbd2c0 zenith #9ebabb sunpale#fff0c4 at normalized(-15,28,12). Shader world dir camera centered sky group follows camera xz inupdate, depthWritefalse depthTesttrue renderOrder-10. Add limited soft clouds using procedural shader noise on dome (no geometric marshmallow clouds); subtle puffy layers covering10-20%sky, no hard islands. <=2drawcalls, no externaltextures. Allgradient colors linear with output colorspace chunk, toneMapped appropriate. No fast day/night, update cloud drift veryslow. Only sky.js.''',
 'island-model':common+'''Create dist/islands.js export createIsland(T,seed=1)->Group. Original refined distant tropical island replacing sphericalgreenbushes. Footprint radius6height5: irregular sandyshore low extruded profile, layered sloping rock masses warmgrey, groundcover patch, 3-5 recognizable palm trees with curved trunks and tapered featheredfronds. Use mergedgeometry bymaterial wherepractical <=16meshes, <=12ktriangles total, no imports/textures/lights. MeshStandardMaterials mutedwarm same references notbrightMinecraft blocks. Root y0sealevel; caller positionsat60-100m. Seed deterministic no modulecache disposableobjects. Objectownsallmaterialsgeometry. No timers. Only islands.js.''',
 'fishing-tool':common+'''Create dist/fishing-tool.js export createFishingTool(T)->Group, original firstperson fishingrod heldinright hand. Root atorigin centered model ylong, length1.5 rod up/forward, warmbamboo sections darktiedwraps metal guides, small reel woodenhandle spindle line ending little redcreamfloat. <=18meshes, credible details, no scene/lights/textures/timers. Coordinate sameheldhook rootcentred aroundorigin enginehandmodule expects hook model sizeless than1; toolwillbeattachedseparately camera (.45,-.4,-.8),rotationx-.3 so rodtipup-left notcrosshair. root.userData grip reference Object3D or vector giveshandlepoint. Allmaterialsowns. Only fishing-tool.js.''',
 'building-tool':common+'''Create dist/hammer.js export createHammer(T)->Group original detailed raftbuildinghammer firstperson. Wornwoodhandle .65long, darksteelhead squarestrikingface/claw, rivetedcollar, ropewrappedgrip, small chipsprocedural geometry/vertexcolors, totalbounds~.8high. Rootcenterorigin, handlebottom-Y, strikingheadtop; heldincameraatright. <=18meshes, MeshStandardMaterials credible steelroughness .45metalness .7 timber .85; no copiedassets/textures/lights/timers. Owngeometriesmaterials. userData.grip vector identifiesgripposition. Only hammer.js.''',
 'rope-geometry':common+'''Create dist/rope.js export createRope(T,{segments=32,radius=.012}={}) -> {mesh,update(points,{tension=0,visible=true}={}),dispose()}. Replace 1pixel Line with actual tan woven rope tube, believable and performant. Preallocated BufferGeometry trianglecylinder rings along input polyline points(Vector3 array16-33) fromhandtohook, interpolate to fixed32segments, localparallelframe stable, radius~.012. Vertexcolors alternating subtle tan twist to implybraid, StandardMaterialroughness1, no texture/lights. update copies ringpositions/normals in-place using stableframes, no newobjects inside perframe; can preallocateVector3. PreventNaNs degenerate points, maxradius.02. meshfrustumCulledfalse visiblefalseinitial. Exposedupdate supportsnullpointshides. Ownmaterialgeometry. No scene/global. Only rope.js.''',
 'hud-review':common+'''READ ONLY audit currentgame screenshotreferences and dist/index/style/graphics/game. User specifically wants zero title/playtogether/headerduringplay, Escapecontainsallmenus, no AI-lookingtoasts, compact8slothotbar, realinventory20stack, scrolling. Return<=8precisefixes with function/selectors, avoiding alreadyfixeditems. No edits.''',
 'physics-review':common+'''READ ONLY designreview for adding jumping/offraft/swimming. Inspectgame.js currentmovement/net protocol/raftwaves and hookphysics. Return exactintegrationconstraints and <=8failurecases to test (feetvs eyeheight, deckcollision, climbing, drowningsoftlock, networkavatarY, livecaptureverticalvelocities). No genericwishlist/noedits.''',
 'inventory-review':common+'''READ ONLY audit currentstock/crafting/save/network to support stack20inventorywithoutduping. Return<=8concreterisks and proposeddataownershipcontract; canonicalstocksharedperworld staysserverauthority, localvisualslotorder allowed, crafting costs atomic. Includeedgecases partialstack,collectbarrel,repair,guestleave/hotupdate. Noedits.''',
 'live-review':common+'''READ ONLY audit dist/live.js plusgame.js lifecycle for runtimecodeupdatewhile2playersjump/swim/craft/inventoryopen. Return<=8actualissues specificallyfailurerollback, callbackownership, stageCSS, legacytransfer, geometrycleanup, preservedroom/inputs. Noedit/nohypotheticalhighsecuritywishlist.''',
 'hook-review':common+'''READ ONLY audit hook-physics.js,game.js,hands.js for realistic chargepullback/throw/reel. Return<=8realgamefeelbugs or sourcecorrectnessissues, suggestsmallnumericchanges and browsercases. Comparetwo references toolscale/hands. Noedits.''',
 'materials-review':common+'''READ ONLY inspectocean/wood/deck/debris/crafts/avatars/hands againsttworeferenceimages. Return<=8specificvisualimprovements performanceaware, numericpalette/roughness/scale. Distinguishactualsourceevidencefromunrenderedassumptions. Noedits.''',
 'mac-performance-review':common+'''READ ONLY inspectgame,deck,debris,crafts,ocean,hands fordrawcalls/geometry/shadows/cpuload onAppleSilicon. Return<=8specificoptimizations avoidchanginggameplay, citefunctions/counts, prioritizehotframeallocations/rebuildleaks. Noedits.''',
 'input-review':common+'''READ ONLY inspect pointerlocksettings/inputcrafting/hotbar interactions. Userwantsnocursorduringplay, Escmenu, jumpSpace, scrollhotbar, Tabinventory, buttonsnotcast. Return<=8actualornewintegrationtestcases with precisebindingsandfailuremodes. Noedits.''',
 'visual-qa-plan':common+'''READ ONLY createconcretevisualQAchecklist <=12screens forraftbenchmark: firstpersonidle,chargedhook,cast,catchreel,Escsettings,inventory20stack,craftsail,lanternnightnotimplementedskip,avatarotherplayer,swimmingedgejump,distantisland. Statewhatgoodlooks like relativetoreferenceimages, cameraframes. Noedits.''',
 'save-review':common+'''READ ONLY auditgamecleanWorld/capture/save/ownWorldBackup plusnewjump/inventorycontracts. Return<=8realpersistence/hotupdatesrisks and minimalversionmigrationplan. Mustpreserveexistingraft,supplies,room,position whilepatching. Noedits.'''
}
